                <p class="mode-title">Made-to-Order</p>
                <p class="mode-desc">You sit at a restaurant, order. The <strong>chef (server) cooks it fresh</strong> and serves a <strong>ready plate</strong> — no cooking required by you.</p>
                <div class="callout callout-blue" style="font-size:.7rem;line-height:1.65;padding:.65rem .9rem;">
                  👨‍🍳 Server = chef running Angular<br/>
