                  🚀 CDN delivers instantly
                </div>
                <div class="mode-pros-cons">
                  <span><span class="pro">✓</span> Instant load, no server</span>
                  <span><span class="pro">✓</span> Best for blogs, docs</span>
                  <span><span class="con">✗</span> Same for all users</span>
                  <span><span class="con">✗</span> Stale if data changes</span>
                </div>
                <div class="mode-code">RenderMode.Prerender</div>
                <p style="font-size:.67rem;color:var(--ink-3);margin-top:.5rem;line-height:1.5;">
                  💡 The rest of the web calls this <strong>SSG</strong>. Angular calls it <strong>Prerender</strong>. Same concept, different name.
