            <p class="eyebrow">06 · Hybrid Rendering</p>
            <h2 class="sec-title">Why Would One App Use Different Rendering Modes for Different Pages?</h2>
            <p class="sec-lead">
              Not all pages are the same. A homepage identical for every visitor has completely different
              needs than a dashboard showing your personal data. Using one rendering strategy for everything
              wastes either server resources or user experience — or both.
            </p>

            <!-- Part A: 3 modes, 3 questions -->
            <div style="margin-bottom:2rem;">
              <p style="font-size:.72rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.09em;color:var(--red);text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:.9rem;">
