                <p style="font-size:.81rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink-1);margin-bottom:.65rem;">🤔 Why not just SSR everything? It works, right?</p>
                <p style="font-size:.76rem;color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.75;margin-bottom:.65rem;">
